TY  - GEN
ID  - 0110001v3
AU  - Mellor, Blake
TI  - A geometric interpretation of Milnor's triple linking numbers
DA  - D:20180803
AB  - Milnor’s triple linking numbers of a link in the 3-sphere are interpreted geometrically in terms of the pattern of intersections of the Seifert surfaces of the components of the link. This generalizes the well known formula as an algebraic count of triple points when the pairwise linking numbers vanish.
ER  - 
